  "_roles": "A role is a SPOKEN grouping that spans classes (or a slice of one by scale) — \"our main base needs more air defense\". `matches` entries are AND-ed within an entry and OR-ed across entries; `scale` pins one ms_scale, `scaleMin`/`scaleMax` bound the range. A role resolving to more than one class cannot fill the single-class `idle-filter` subject the current compile table exposes, so the local slot-filler leaves it unmatched rather than guessing one branch; the M1 envelope carries roles properly.",
